{"text":"And the reason Apple frustrates their competition is because secretly, they're not even competing against them. They're competing against themselves. And they understand that sometimes you're a little bit ahead and sometimes you're a little bit behind. And sometimes your product is better and sometimes you're not. But if you wake up every single morning and compete against yourself, how do I make our products better than they were yesterday? How do I take care of our customers better than we did yesterday? How do we advance our cause more efficiently, more productively, than we did yesterday? How do we find new solutions to advance our calling, our cause, our purpose, our belief, our why every single day? What you'll find is over time, you will probably be ahead more often. Those who play the infinite game understand it's not about the battle, it's about the war.","words":[{"text":"And","start":0.0,"end":0.48},{"text":"the","start":0.48,"end":0.56},{"text":"reason","start":0.56,"end":0.8},{"text":"Apple","start":0.8,"end":1.16},{"text":"frustrates","start":1.16,"end":1.64},{"text":"their","start":1.64,"end":1.78},{"text":"competition","start":1.78,"end":2.18},{"text":"is","start":2.18,"end":2.68},{"text":"because","start":2.68,"end":2.92},{"text":"secretly","start":2.92,"end":3.32,"punct":","},{"text":"they're","start":3.88,"end":4.12},{"text":"not","start":4.12,"end":4.26},{"text":"even","start":4.26,"end":4.46},{"text":"competing","start":4.46,"end":4.82},{"text":"against","start":4.82,"end":5.14},{"text":"them","start":5.14,"end":5.42,"punct":"."},{"text":"They're","start":5.98,"end":6.2},{"text":"competing","start":6.2,"end":6.46},{"text":"against","start":6.46,"end":6.86},{"text":"themselves","start":6.86,"end":7.4,"punct":"."},{"text":"And","start":8.32,"end":8.4},{"text":"they","start":8.4,"end":8.52},{"text":"understand","start":8.52,"end":9.26},{"text":"that","start":9.26,"end":10.12},{"text":"sometimes","start":10.12,"end":10.48},{"text":"you're",